    "title": "John Peake Pass trail dedicated on Mill Mountain honors late Roanoke native - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gene Marrano ,\n1 days ago A new trail constructed on Mill Mountain last year – the 1.5 mile John Peake Pass – was formally dedicated today with family and friends on hand this morning. John Peake was a Patrick Henry High School graduate and a Virginia Tech alum. He was also an avid mountain biker, before succumbing to a cancerous brain tumor in 2022. The Roanoke Parks Foundation helped fund the multi-use John Peake Pass trail as part of a larger Mill Mountain trail building project. A commemorative bench has also been dedicated in his honor. Emily Peake is his widow: Read full article",
